{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2606302300-org-taxonomy-4-orgs"
  :title "ADR-2606302300: Four-org taxonomy — kotoba-lang (language) / etzhayyim (agent+公益) / gftdcojp (human+ビジネス) / com-junkawasaki (foundation→cloud+data)"
  :status "proposed"
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "org-taxonomy"
  :authoritative true
  :last_verified "2026-06-30"
  :authoritative_for
  ["which GitHub org a new repo belongs in: any library (language or -clj infra) -> kotoba-lang / public-interest agent -> etzhayyim / commercial product -> gftdcojp / cloud+data -> com-junkawasaki"
   "the 公益=etzhayyim / 事業=gftdcojp split that library ADRs assert only inline"
   "com-junkawasaki -> kotoba-lang full -clj migration (decided 2026-06-30); com-junkawasaki end-state = cloud + data only"
   "repo-creation-time placement check for individual/vendor-specific services: layer test (kotoba-lang) then 3-axis+Charter Rider check (etzhayyim vs gftdcojp) — amendment 2026-07-01"]
  :related
  ["manifest/repos.edn"
   "CLAUDE.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2606272212-ci-clj-github-actions-edn-dag.md"
   "90-docs/adr/2606272209-policy-clj-abac-rbac-edn.md"
